          <description>If desired the Prow Torpedoes can be replaced by a Nova Cannon at an additional cost of +20 pts or refitted torpedoes from p.156 of ARMADA can be used for an additional cost of +20pts. This profile for the Dictator class cruiser already reflects the rule changes for an Adeptus Mechanicus vessel and in addition requires a roll on the Mechanicus Gift Table.</description>
