      </entryLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Endeavour Light Cruiser" id="a271-773f-17fa-7c7e" hidden="false">
          <description>Special Rules. Endeavour light cruisers get a +1 to their dice roll when defending against a boarding action, because the mid-ship corridor is easy to defend and restricts access to vital parts of the ship. May replace torpedoes with a single 30cm dorsal lance turret firing left/front/right for no cost.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
