      <rules>
        <rule name="Mechanicus Tyrant Class Cruiser" id="4925-cd40-44e8-7910" hidden="false">
          <description>Notes: If desired the Prow Torpedoes can be replaced by a Nova Cannon at an additional cost of +20 pts or refitted torpedoes from p.156 of ARMADA can be used for an additional cost of +20pts. This profile for the Tyrant class cruiser already reflects the rule changes for an Adeptus Mechanicus vessel and in addition requires a roll on the Mechanicus Gift Table.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
